WEBVTT

00:06:00.356 --> 00:06:03.916
Maybe no one would show up in real life.

00:06:04.636 --> 00:06:08.916
Maybe all the discussions
in real life would be awful.

00:06:09.556 --> 00:06:12.516
Or maybe we had an axe murderer
in our database.

00:06:12.516 --> 00:06:13.956
(Laughter)

00:06:14.956 --> 00:06:19.636
But then, on a Sunday in June 2017,

00:06:19.676 --> 00:06:21.516
something beautiful happened.

00:06:22.636 --> 00:06:28.276
Thousands of Germans met in pairs
and talked about politics peacefully.

00:06:28.836 --> 00:06:29.996
Like Anno.